## 25. Worked Example: Password Strength Checker

### Problem

Input a password and decide whether it is strong.

### Decomposition

```text
input password
check length
check uppercase letter
check lowercase letter
check digit
check special character
count passed rules
output strength result
```

### Possible Output

```text
Weak
Medium
Strong
```

